  "result": "Two tile plates, printer and water jug delivered as four native PNGs. Floor held after two attempts: inner rectangles 1407x818 and 1408x820, about 3.20% and 3.02% wider than the required 5:3 ratio. A square 30x18 grid leaves side strips, so w22/w23 full-floor handoff geometry needs root resolution. Tile opaque edges are 718x719 and 1092x1093; separate uniform transforms give 200px and 300px body widths (2:3), preserving native files and their one-pixel edge uncertainty. Printer checked at 300px, jug at 320px on paper/dark. Jug has strong white watercolour highlights on dark; no volume marks or counted glasses. Literal learning-review Status hold remains.",
